  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Parliamentary support project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance the capacity of federal parliaments and provincial assemblies to be effective and participatory, and to be open, interactive and accountable to citizens. Enhance the capacity of parliamentary secretariats to be capable and innovative in their support to MPs and committees. Build the capacity of women MPs and MPs from disadvantaged groups to be effective and for Federal parliament and provincial assemblies to routinely engage with women, youth and other disadvantaged citizen.</narrative>
  </description>
